Deep Research Public Release Notice

Code license: the source code in deep_research/, scripts/, tests/, and the
paper's analysis scripts are licensed under Apache-2.0, as stated in LICENSE.

Data license boundary: public data files are mixed-license research inputs. The
root Apache-2.0 license does not override upstream licenses for third-party
benchmark rows. See DATA_LICENSES.md for the row-level source table. In brief:
DRACO rows are MIT, DeepSearchQA rows are Apache-2.0, ResearchQA rows are MIT,
LitQA2/LAB-Bench rows are CC-BY-SA-4.0, and custom rows are Apache-2.0.

Public redaction: one DRACO-derived affiliate-marketing query was anonymized
before public release to remove a named individual, a small-business identifier,
and a private-planning-board reference while preserving the evaluation task
shape.

Excluded material: generated reports, raw judge verdict forests, local API/search
caches, paper drafts, LaTeX sources, private notes, model weights, and
checkpoints are intentionally not part of the public GitHub release. The
local/GPU pattern implementations (P9-P17) are included as runnable code; the
model weights they load are fetched from Hugging Face at run time.
